{"Title":"An Act to reform veterans’ services at the municipal level","BillNumber":"H3709","DocketNumber":"HD2937","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"SBA1","Name":"Shirley B. Arriaga","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SBA1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-15T11:42:51.653"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"SBA1","Name":"Shirley B. Arriaga","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SBA1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-15T11:42:51.6533333"},{"Id":"SGX1","Name":"Steven George Xiarhos","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SGX1","ResponseDate":"2023-06-22T12:17:44.5633333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3709/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Arriaga of Chicopee, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3709) of Shirley B. Arriaga for legislation to provide for the appointment of full-time veterans' agents or directors of veterans’ services in certain cities and towns.  Veterans and Federal Affairs.","DocumentText":"\tSection 10 of chapter 115 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by adding the following paragraph:-\r\n\tAny city or town having a population over 12,000 and having a part-time veterans’ agent or part-time director of veterans’ services shall, at the start of the fiscal year, appoint a full time veteran’s agent or director of veterans’ services. If any city or town, having a population over 12,000, fails to appoint a full time veteran’s agent or director of veterans’ services, the secretary shall issue a civil penalty, not to exceed $5,000, for each month of noncompliance. Each month of noncompliance by the city or town shall be deemed a separate offense and such penalty shall be in addition to any other penalties provided by law.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J31"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}